{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "36b7a3a955fb05f31e13d6d9c251fd449471055880b9ba0f502ae190709cd887", "ja": "いつの日か！", "zh": "总有一天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2a34f29d3d52cdf815ef480901f0a4704a85dcb2bc871f8bbbb32829c8aae9f1", "ja": "配信番組のゲスト最終日。『はるみら』公演\nの映像を流してもらう。感動する芸人さん、\n実は春香のファンだった先輩テニス選手から\nたくさんの言葉をもらい、ふたりは互いに、\nトップアイドルを目指す事を宣言する。", "zh": "直播节目的最后一天嘉宾环节。请节目播放『はるみら』公演的影像。两人从深受感动的喜剧演员，以及其实是春香粉丝的前辈网球选手那里听到了许多话，并彼此宣言要以成为顶级偶像为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d22dc3282c2ee7709b10ff901f13f6240ca6693ed777e6ff4a00248d7a3140c5", "ja": "（今日は、配信番組のゲスト最終日。特別に、\n『はるみら』公演の映像を流してもらう事になった）", "zh": "（今天是直播节目的最后一天嘉宾。特别安排播放《春美来》的公演影像）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1104403a343170edaac95d66d3a9d036ab0398a0c0b5c26b8d731507907ba450", "ja": "『私たちの新曲で、\nハルカナミライでしたー！』", "zh": "我们的新歌，\n《遥远的未来》——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "13a277a075e1752df2c31ace5d7143775460b3683448abe753f07737c8f62e26", "ja": "『まだまだライブは始まったばっかり！\n全力で楽しんでいこーっ！！』", "zh": "『演唱会才刚刚开始！\n接下来也要全力享受哦——！！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1003_mc", "source_sha256": "1dc4742cde5026ccf49262f992674fea75c2fef7efe7fdce958ff01826615309", "ja": "……と、いうわけで『はるみら』公演の様子を\n特別編集版で見せてもらったんですが……。", "zh": "……话虽如此，我看了特别编辑版的\n“春未来”演出过程之后……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1004_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "9de26d74865d2448a6fa26149783dbfe0d5e3d173137c851fd880d2fdb1cad02", "ja": "よかったわ～。アイドルって、どうしてこんなに\nキラキラしてるのかしら……まるで別人みたい……。", "zh": "太好了～。偶像为什么会如此闪闪发光呢……简直像变了个人一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1005_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "ee44ef344909085cc5a8a1f060677b3bb90dd09b9876ecd6d8ad8aa1972db142", "ja": "でもさぁ、番組で見た顔もたまに覗けてさ……\n頑張ってんだってわかっちゃって……そこが、ぐすっ。", "zh": "不过呢，偶尔还能看到节目里见过的面孔……知道她们都在努力……就是这里，呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "a473e58af8cfec8e4647da803b01f8e40a6b8615c95c6f2635814e9237b6cbfc", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！\nそんなふうに言ってもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你！\n没想到你会这样说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1007_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "ce584125b10cdd0b8d2bf4d528a72cf8e3920ac4f2d36ee53e305a3aeda69874", "ja": "現地で見た感動がよみがえってきちゃった。\nやっぱり何回見ても、元気もらえるよね……。", "zh": "现场所见的感动又重新涌上心头了。\n果然不管看多少次，都会让人重新振作起来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "7984fdae10effe7828d0347022c65a21ae40ec37120a34e8894a6db51db0333e", "ja": "現地……え？　もしかして、公演来てくれたんですか？", "zh": "现场……咦？难道说，您来观看演出了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1009_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "3439d542e2a6c732a675cb876d581221e330cb00b419180348698b3de3e5b227", "ja": "やっぱり推しはファン目線で見ないと……。\n特別扱いみたいなのはあんまり……。", "zh": "对于自己的本命，果然还是得站在粉丝视角来看……\n搞特殊优待之类的还是不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "11626d15fc6f6877cdd0fe2ec5a8ce2ead2b2c00432ca868644606386479487f", "ja": "推し……？", "zh": "推……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1011_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "3f1f05a594a96686ed7f652d7ff7308804f7751325d908a4d19f4c78f3381cb0", "ja": "黙ってたけど先輩、春香さん推しなんです。\n公演も先輩に連れていかれる感じで……。", "zh": "虽然一直没说，但前辈其实是春香小姐的粉丝。演出也是被前辈带着去的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "a5b43fe85a5e22cd48b1183854e34dd18728ccf7408ebf4fb0281341b16f55b8", "ja": "そうだったんだ……！", "zh": "原来是这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1013_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "ec97cb49c12de345a8c272b45a0db7488049b21f39010d4af90f50368da48b70", "ja": "い、言わなくていいから！！\nその、こっそり応援したいので……。", "zh": "不、不用说出来啦！！\n那个……我想偷偷给你加油……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "34ec58f1da26d7d9d8045265332fc6195b9f344bf85da349c499f1680ee563d6", "ja": "こんな近くにファンの人がいたんだ……！\n春香さん、何か一言！", "zh": "原来粉丝就在这么近的地方……！\n春香，能不能说句话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "25dd70e69bfa5f827787b48e37e28641d5a47a5ffe28aa74bf0df27ddb79d1fb", "ja": "えっと……あの、ありがとうございます！\nとってもうれしいです！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "那个……谢谢你！\n我真的特别开心！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1016_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "936a3d58f35525050f3f5b88713c736d57e9f3bd76b170d3e4c97aac1eeabbb3", "ja": "私は先を走ったり、たまに追い越されたり……\n歌詞のそういうところにすごく共感しちゃったな。", "zh": "有时跑在前面，有时又被超过……\n歌词里的这些地方，让我特别有共鸣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1017_mc", "source_sha256": "416479018224c57881da1cbe9c266d0703a6abfd4b68e8301cf1a27ecb44e16c", "ja": "番組の『先輩と後輩』というコンセプトとも\n通じますね。歌う時は関係性を意識したり……？", "zh": "这也和节目的“前辈与后辈”这一理念相通呢。唱歌时会不会也意识到彼此的关系……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "0ceef756aa0d86f6ec4d75b5f68ebaf42afd40bfe7ffad6d5335a30eb51b5e8c", "ja": "意識なんて言うと大げさな気がしちゃいますけど……\nでも私、今回、気が付いたことがあって。", "zh": "说是有意识去注意，可能显得有点夸张了……\n不过我这次，注意到了这点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "0260f8b7388b23f5edc71b38a5ef36b73dcce386a9edb2f8db2aff31c5458ac8", "ja": "私は最初から先輩だったんじゃなくて……未来ちゃんが\n劇場に来てくれたから、先輩になったんだって。", "zh": "我并不是一开始就是前辈……是因为未来来到了剧场，我才成为前辈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "025700d0d86bc3838927b2f8e348bccee91055030cbb8608123eed42eb1ff548", "ja": "未来ちゃんが、\n私を先輩にしてくれたんだって。", "zh": "是未来，让我成为了前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "83ed9b8fee1dc0cf0d2d49efe661f78dbf0f87791b068cc8c8324d6811d44577", "ja": "春香さん……。", "zh": "春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "2a8ce77d1ea4c1aa635b955b1a6610fd71ae499bc250df24ef0e0ac066b10490", "ja": "私たち、仲良し姉妹みたいって言われることもあって。\nでも仲間でもあり、ライバルでもありますから。", "zh": "有时候大家会说我们就像感情好的姐妹呢。\n不过我们既是伙伴，也是对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1023_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "9fc8ea420e1147d5daf1cc09c5b46041a2899921f11c39c4da51fba5a8a5ea7b", "ja": "『仲良し姉妹』『仲間でライバル』……\nあら、それって前に私たちが言ったやつ……？", "zh": "“要好姐妹”“既是伙伴又是对手”……\n咦，那不是我们之前说过的话吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "5cc59adaf715af3ef192f9e80ee3c60505b30ba46e34fb7352c1908a42beff5e", "ja": "はい！　私たちは、それぞれが\n『トップアイドルを目指す』ふたりですから。", "zh": "是的！我们分别都是以『成为顶尖偶像』为目标的两个人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "744261c1e36f5923869a400bbaff0f036ee6f213e592791c06fc7ab9af110a35", "ja": "ひとつの言葉だけじゃまとまらないので。\nだからここは、欲張って、全部入りです！", "zh": "光靠一句话是总结不起来的。\n所以这次就贪心一点，把所有内容都放进去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1026_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "c84e4c471c6ce4aa81883411c9de002bfe8bc49e50dd778b01a8bd7e75e4a697", "ja": "まぶしい……年取ると簡単に泣いちゃって、\n私泣くキャラじゃないんだけど、ほんと……ぐすっ。", "zh": "太耀眼了……年纪大了就很容易哭，\n我明明不是爱哭的角色，真的……抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1027_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "7891f9d55543d29166a461246099fd7f0e6e87ed441a7127c3b7a1b8e6c32f3b", "ja": "それなら、未来ちゃんは？\n春香さんに応えてあげなくちゃ。", "zh": "那么，未来呢？\n你得回应春香才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "2012d42765d3e1c1a280c27926cc674ffa08e7a9dc66037fc050e79659905690", "ja": "はい。春香さんは、私をいつも導いてくれるけど……\nいつか私も、春香さんのことを引っ張ってみたい！", "zh": "嗯。春香前辈总是引导着我，不过……\n总有一天，我也想带着春香前辈一起前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "d7ccf6433c7c775b15c790a4ec2f3aa453b150d4117900e89ce33d885202c9d6", "ja": "だから、そうなれるようにがんばってがんばって……\nトップアイドル、目指してます！", "zh": "所以，我会努力、努力地成为那样的人……\n以顶级偶像为目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "8b0558749c4dd1462caa8cb5f574c02a09358c3685843400217c2c86f6206f0b", "ja": "うん。\n……お互い、頑張ろうね！", "zh": "嗯。\n……我们都要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "810e43ed5ae32d3ac80a54f6bb23436ab3e3c35fbef585e7baefc7c3b9be6b3d", "ja": "（どんな世界であれ、トップへの道は\n遠く、厳しく、果てしない）", "zh": "（无论身处怎样的世界，通往顶峰的道路\n都遥远、艰难，而且无穷无尽）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8e0a043e3b8ad3b66e7db8173a080f535c26981b9550187d44d766a7c5c3aeab", "ja": "（でも、ふたりのように……追いかけ追いかけられ、\n走り続ける勇気を持っていれば……必ず！）", "zh": "（不管是什么样的世界，通往顶峰的道路都漫长、艰苦、无止境。但如果拥有像两人那样……不断追赶、被追赶，持续奔跑的勇气……就一定能！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
